    <div class="reveal wrap" id="reveal">
      <div class="sticky"><div class="inner">
        <p id="reveal-line">I'm an AI Software Engineer in London. I build AI agents and the APIs, data and deployments that keep them running. I also build open-source tools for coding agents, like Claude Anchor and Brainvault.</p>
